  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n⇒ **({3of5frac{1)/(2) + 6 div 5 - 2of3 div 4}}{{1 + (3)/({1 + frac{1){4}}}of5 - 3(1)/(3)of2 div 5}}**\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47370b0626128df212f2edfaa682c86866fe2d62d3725f3ea6cf4f4de186cf14.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒({3offrac{11)/(2) + 6 div 5 - 2of3 div 4}}{{1 + (3)/({1 + frac{1){4}}}of5 - 3(1)/(3)of2 div 5}} \n\n⇒ frac{{{33over2} + {6over5} - 2×3 div 4}}{{1 + (3)/({1 + frac{1){4}}}of5 - {10over3}of2 div 5}}\n\n⇒ frac{{{33over2} + {6over5} - 2×3 div 4}}{{1 + (12)/(5)of5 - {10over3}of(2)/(5)}}\n\n⇒ frac{{{33over2} + {6over5} - 2×3 div 4}}{{1 + ((12)/(5)×5) - ({10over3}times(2)/(5)})}\n\n⇒ ({frac{33)/(2) +frac{6} 5 - frac 3 2}}{{13 - (4)/(3)}}\n\n⇒ ({frac{162)/(10) }}{{ (35)/(3)}}\n\n⇒ frac{{243}}{{175}}\n\n**Hence, the value of expression is 243/175.**",
